| YSFlight M1 tests. Started by !Run in a task window.
| Each run's output (stdout) and its error output (stderr: messages, and
| the crash report with the RISC OS error and a backtrace) go to files in
| <YSFlight$Dir>.Logs. UnixLib does the > and 2> redirection; Do expands
| the <variables> in the arguments, which Run alone doesn't.
WimpSlot -min 16384K
CDir <YSFlight$Dir>.Logs
Echo YSFlight M1 tests. Each step can take a while.
Echo 1/4 Aircraft list...
Do Run <YSFlight$Dir>.!RunImage -listairplane ><YSFlight$Dir>.Logs.Aircraft 2><YSFlight$Dir>.Logs.AircraftE
Echo 2/4 Field list...
Do Run <YSFlight$Dir>.!RunImage -listfield ><YSFlight$Dir>.Logs.Fields 2><YSFlight$Dir>.Logs.FieldsE
Echo 3/4 Start positions on Aomori...
Do Run <YSFlight$Dir>.!RunImage -liststartpos AOMORI ><YSFlight$Dir>.Logs.Aomori 2><YSFlight$Dir>.Logs.AomoriE
Echo 4/4 Start positions on Hawaii...
Do Run <YSFlight$Dir>.!RunImage -liststartpos HAWAII ><YSFlight$Dir>.Logs.Hawaii 2><YSFlight$Dir>.Logs.HawaiiE
Echo Done. Now the server: it loads a map and flies AI traffic.
Echo Leave it a few minutes, then press Escape to stop it.
Do Run <YSFlight$Dir>.!RunImage -server pi 2><YSFlight$Dir>.Logs.ServerE
Echo Finished. Please send the files in !YSFlight.Logs and this window's text.
